I walk to the tram stop on the corner.
That is only a short walk from my flat.
My tram is already coming.
I get on.
I immediately find a seat by the window.
The tram sets off.
First we go straight ahead.
Then we turn right.
The ride is very nice.
In the U-Bahn it is always dark.
But up here I see the city.
I look out of the window.
I see many shops and large buildings.
Everything is still new to me.
I do not know these streets.
Sabine is really right.
The tram is a great idea.
I enjoy the ride to the centre.
